    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Platform 3 secondary patrol complete. Target pod in position, no suspicious individuals detected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no one else left on this little platform but us. What's the sitch on your end?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The four pods' engines have undergone breakpoint testing, and the park's about to enter the intercity net's range.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember the official line to the public: The gathering is only temporary, and they can all return to their respective exhibit areas once the broadcast's intro segment is done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_metalroll",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure everyone's gone on your end? The Tin Man stressed we had to make sure all park personnel are safely evacuated before we send the operation signal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The main road was sealed off an hour ago, the support platform's emergency jump pads are all shut, and the cable car routes were all diverted to only go in one direction last night, so no one's been able to get in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Better play it safe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "100,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ropeway station needs backup. That Rhine research assistant is blocking the access hub with a group of testers, and it's hard to get around them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Communicator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah, go back them up. It's crucial we time this right, every preparatory step has to be complete before the broadcast begins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, over here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A soda bottle cap?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Probably rolled off the table from the floating pod shaking. It's probably nothing, let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
