    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... M-Mr. Aspen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What on earth is your obsession with that balloon?! The couch is small enough without you hanging onto that, I almost got squished flat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Miss Barn... but I begged you to take me here just for this balloon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have no idea how much effort it took slipping right out from under their noses and then getting you here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really sorry about that... could you hand me the toolbox from the closet? The evacuation announcement came so suddenly, I didn't have the time to make sure the floating pods would be alright during the stream...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want the Lucky Cystybeast on display at the expo that badly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ignoring a public hearing, signing a temp contract with a tour guide with multiple charges under her belt, and helping her escape park security just so you can have her bring you back to a sealed-off levitation layer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "text": "You guys! All nuts for the sky!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm drowning in debt here. The only way to clear it is to have the Lucky Cystybeast at the show and draw in investors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, yeah. 'The sky will answer every future seeker', and all that jazz. Propeller Paradise's slogan is plastered all over the place, trashcan lids in the slums included.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if it's blind faith, I'm not going to give up now after coming this far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_guitartap",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
