    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$formal_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#12$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me through! The tree's hard drive and motherboard haven't been removed yet\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't push your luck!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Allowing the Rhine tree at the expo has been our biggest concession to Rhine Lab, and we've even been so generous as to let you copy the data for future research. What more do you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just need five minutes! I promise I won't pull any tricks either! Hasn't the ATAO's Science Consultant issued a report on the tree? It's completely harmless!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. All levitation layer personnel are to return to the ground to ensure the exhibits are finalized, and only return after the opening speech.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, the uplink cable cars aren't operating now, so there's no way you can reach the Rhine tree. It's at the highest point in the park.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't realize how much effort Director Lunorey put into this experiment until I saw the core code, and now I remember, how she never abandoned her dreams for the sky...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if it only saves a little backtracking time later, I want to help her somehow... you have to let me through!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Jagger, one more move and we'll have to resort to more special methods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "150,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "duration": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-150,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "duration": 0.6
