    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The expo is about to open, with the Columbian sun shining brightly. The crowd follows Sky's finger, and spots a dazzling tree.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The branches wrapped in special material should have been completely still, like tiny insects trapped in resin. However, right here and now under the sunlight, the broken branches seem to glow... green.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "50,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "-50,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "68_g5_floatingstation",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Organic materials don't photosynthesize...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The park handbook states clearly it is common for exhibits to transform in high-altitude environments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "50,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "-50,0"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhine stuff doesn't do that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it doesn't give you an excuse to go back up there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "50,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "-50,0"
    },
    {
        "text": "Going up there won't solve the problem, I have no idea what exactly's going on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I know who does.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walkfast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2046_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? He just left, that easily?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Council Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "68_g4_floatingplatform",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Levitation layer, eleven main platforms, and twenty support platforms have been inspected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Communicator"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Jammers and backup detonators have been installed in nine smaller levitation pods, which will crash one-by-one when activated...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Communicator"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Personnel evacuation is complete. Scouts have done multiple calculations of the fallout curve based on current wind direction and force, and have confirmed falling debris will not reach the square serving as the evacuation spot...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Communicator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2047_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All areas progressing well. Gustave sends word from the Cloud restaurant's cockpit that Propeller Paradise will be within D.C. intercity net range in five minutes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your orders, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyone seen those two newbies from Bravo?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tin Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2047_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ones responsible for that Banshee? Positioning shows they're still on Platform 3. That's not in the plan's operation range. Should we send someone to check it out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like their mission's been 'taken over'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tin Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Platform 3 is far from the detonation target, so don't worry about that. I'll handle it later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tin Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "All teams, sync chronos. Phase two begins now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tin Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_cellroomB",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$calm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "The jail cell window crops the sky into a tiny square."
    },
    {
        "text": "The ordinary yet mysterious 'tree', centerpiece of Nasti's research, and Rhine Lab's core project, is now hidden from her view by strangely clothed figures and floating balloons."
    },
    {
        "text": "In a few minutes, the expo broadcast will begin, without Nasti's involvement. Her bone pen and mechanical devices were seized earlier, so all she needs to do now is to play the role of a helpless sinner."
    },
    {
        "text": "If Muelsyse were here, she'd probably summon eight water clones to scold her for being silly. But Nasti does not regret her decision, though there is one woman on her mind."
    },
    {
        "text": "V\u00e6la leaving the Convallis had always left her uneasy. If the chance came..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pick_lock",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "l",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$escape_intro",
        "key": "$escape_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Director Lunorey, you have to follow me to the tree platform!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're supposed to be keeping the device data and core code safe. What are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the 'tree' is <i>growing</i> now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "...'Growing'? That's impossible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's not supposed to happen... If it affects the levitation module, it'll definitely be dangerous to anyone on the ground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The levitation module runs independently, with a backup power supply that can last for five days. But the abnormality you mentioned... the only way to find out why it's happening is to go inside the 'tree'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me, Director.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "text": "The security cams have been rigged with a delayed feed that should buy us at least twenty minutes, and I'm not sure why, but the cell's smart locks are unlocked, so now's\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because the chief executive of 'Propeller Paradise' opened them for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fsmummy",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "f",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gordon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
