    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "aduration": 1,
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's... all that on you? A DIY high-altitude face shield, modified propellers, and a second-hand insulated spacesuit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 2,
        "clear": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "clear": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you loot them from the park's scrap and recycle plant?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your distorted testimony at the hearing is still up on the park's bulletin board, but now you're helping us escape...? Don't tell me you've had a sudden attack of conscience?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nasti, I got your bone pen and devices here. Sorry about the hearing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd rather stand in the defendant's dock with you than recite that prepared speech\u2014after all, the confiscated devices were my goods anyways, so I'll take the blame for that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who are you and what have you done with Gordon Tannen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_broadcast_third"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "My dear citizens of D.C., and those watching this live broadcast, it is my honor to introduce Propeller Paradise, an experimental park that is sure to leave its mark on Columbian history!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Park Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have much time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nasti, you've done deals with Gustave. I'm sure you won't doubt the intel I'm about to hand over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your old boss is planning something with Maylander, correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're even sharper than I thought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing the park's chief executive here when he's supposed to be making a speech in half an hour is proof enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Friends, look out your windows, up at the sky. No amount of marketing bluster can compare to what you'll see with your own eyes, where the future among the clouds is waiting for you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Park Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They want to can the expo with an accident that'll kill the future of Propeller Paradise, though I've no idea exactly what their plan is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Maylander's involved, they'll move fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "God, am I seeing things? Something's falling from the levitation layer\u2014Is that the Lucky Cystybeast's floating pod?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Park Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, there's more! Three... four... Is this part of the opening ceremony? They didn't mention this in the script! If they really come crashing down\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Park Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! The pods stopped falling? As if something's gripping them firmly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Park Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What was that? Oh, oh! It seems the tech companies have prepared a surprise that even got me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Park Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have just witnessed Propeller Paradise's breakthrough in the field of levitation, with no need for papers or data, and this is only just the beginning!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Park Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No way, there's no emergency stop module\u2014even in ongoing projects\u2014that could've done that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sky, your field measurements are more precise. Where were the falling pods supposed to land?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2039_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "From visual estimates, they would have probably crashed into Platform 2, blocking the connecting lower layer tunnel\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the only path we can take to the tree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sky Jagger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gordon, I accept your apology, but I have no time for your plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That miracle was no stroke of luck. Might have something to do with you and your invention?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that a threat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just my intuitive judgment on all rule-breaking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need your help with Gustave, but I do need a bargaining chip to make sure Propeller Paradise stays afloat when everything's done and dusted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So my tree...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Letting you handle something only you know how to handle is part of my plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it. Rhine Lab staff will cooperate with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "text": "However. Whatever it is you're planning to do, go to the tree at the first sign of danger and I'll come get you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
